2:T428,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HowTo","name":"How to Create a Perfect JEE Study Plan Using AI in 2026","description":"Learn how AI-powered planning tools like PlanBot can help JEE aspirants create optimized, personalized study schedules that adapt to their preparation level...","step":[{"@type":"HowToStep","position":1,"name":"Choose Your Persona","text":"Open PlanBot and select the Student persona to optimize for exam preparation, study blocks, and revision cycles."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":2,"name":"Describe Your Goal","text":"Tell PlanBot your target exam (e.g. JEE Main), your timeline, weak subjects, and available daily study hours."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":3,"name":"Get Your AI-Generated Plan","text":"Review the daily schedule created by PlanBot's AI, which includes subject-wise time allocation, breaks, and revision slots."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":4,"name":"Track Your Streaks","text":"Follow the plan daily to grow your streak. Use the gamification system to stay motivated and avoid breaking your streak."}]}a:["slug","how-to-create-jee-study-plan-with-ai","d"]
