3:[["$","div",null,{"className":"aeo-answer tl-dr","children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Quick Answer:"}]," To create a JEE study plan with AI: (1) Download PlanBot from Google Play Store, (2) Select the Student persona, (3) Tell the AI your JEE target, exam date, weak subjects, and available study hours, (4) Review the AI-generated daily schedule with subject-wise time blocks, and (5) Follow the plan daily using streaks for consistency. The AI handles subject rotation, revision scheduling, and break timing automatically."]}]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why Most JEE Study Plans Fail"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Every JEE aspirant starts with a study plan. Most abandon it within a week. Why? Because generic study plans don't account for ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"your"}]," strengths, weaknesses, available time, and energy patterns."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"A student who excels at Physics but struggles with Organic Chemistry needs a fundamentally different schedule than someone who breezes through Math but can't crack Thermodynamics."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"How AI Changes the Game"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["AI-powered planners like ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"PlanBot"}]," analyze your specific situation and generate plans that actually work. Instead of copying someone else's schedule from YouTube, you get a plan tailored to:"]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Your current preparation level"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Your target score and rank"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Your available study hours"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Your strong and weak subjects"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step-by-Step: Creating Your JEE Plan with PlanBot"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"1. Choose Your Persona"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["When you first open PlanBot, select the ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Student"}]," persona. This tells the AI to optimize for exam preparation, study blocks, and revision cycles."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"2. Describe Your Goal"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Tell PlanBot something like: ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"I'm preparing for JEE Main 2027. I have 8 months. I'm strong in Math, average in Physics, and weak in Chemistry. I can study 6 hours daily.\""}]]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"3. Get Your AI-Generated Plan"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"PlanBot's AI creates a daily schedule with:"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Subject-wise time allocation"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Break optimization"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Revision slots"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Practice test scheduling"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"4. Track Your Streaks"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Every day you follow the plan, your streak grows. PlanBot's gamification system keeps you motivated with XP, levels, and streak freeze protection."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Key Tips for JEE Aspirants"}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Start with weak subjects"}]," when energy is highest (morning)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Use active recall"}]," — don't just read, solve problems"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Take mock tests weekly"}]," — PlanBot can schedule these"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Protect your streaks"}]," — consistency beats intensity"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Review AI reports"}]," — Elite and God tier users get weekly performance analysis"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why PlanBot Works for JEE"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Unlike generic planning apps, PlanBot understands academic goals. The AI doesn't just create a to-do list — it creates an ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"optimized study strategy"}]," that adapts as you progress."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"PlanBot is free on Android."}]," Start with 2 AI-generated plans per day and upgrade to Pro, Elite, or God tier for more powerful AI models and unlimited plans."]}],"\n",["$","hr",null,{}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","em",null,{"children":["Planning to crack JEE? ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cpm.planbot","children":"Download PlanBot"}]," and let AI build your perfect study schedule."]}]}]]
